# 2026-09-14 — Monday

## Evening

First full week of term and it already feels real. [[algorithms]] is going to be the hard
one this semester — the professor moves fast, and the first problem set is due Friday.
[[maya|Maya]] and I agreed to work through problem sets together on Mondays and Thursdays
in the library.

Did my first shift at the campus library tonight. Mostly reshelving and helping people
find the printer. Four hours, and I can do readings on the quiet desk, which is the dream.
See [[income]].

Feeling good about this term. #mood/positive
