# 2026-10-01 — Thursday

## Afternoon

Kicked off the [[databases]] group project with [[leo|Leo]]. We''re building a small
library-checkout system — feels appropriate. I''m taking the schema and queries, he''s
taking the API. We meet Thursdays after the lab.

