# 2026-10-04 — Saturday

Finally deployed the [[portfolio-site]]. It''s just three pages and a projects list, but
it''s live and it''s mine.

Went for an 8 km run along the river — longest one this term. See [[fitness]].

Called [[dad|Dad]]. He''s three weekends into restoring an old road bike and sent me about
twenty photos of the gears. He wants to ride it with me over the holidays.
#mood/positive
